<p><bold>Microscopic/Cellular Changes</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 214.409px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Clinical Correlates</bold></p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 123.602px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Initial Colonization</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 307.352px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Pathogen adheres to conjunctival epithelium via pili/receptors or viral entry glycoproteins</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 214.409px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
